            standing: Maker,
            as_read: "Parker 451TC: 2 in (50 mm) at -4 up to 8 1/4 in (210 mm) at -20, measured to the inside of the bend",
            source: [R(6)],
            note: "A hose's radius is its maker's wherever it is laid. The rubber water hose has no sheet of its own yet: its size rows borrow the hydraulic hose's figure at the same bore and say so.",
        ),
